  :runtime "For each entry the named seam was read, and for the runtime-inhabitant question the CALLERS were counted across futon2 src/, scripts/, checks/ and test/ -- a namespace whose only references are prose and tests is recorded as such."
  :sweep-basis "Holes.lean abbrevs/structures at 6751-7148 (the AIF spine) plus the three sorry-bodied definitions outside it (C:157, find:307, organise:999); the ten declarations the emission marks kind=hole (holes-contract.json)."
