  "Lean cannot decide that a signature is uninhabited, and the corpus proves the point: every carrier in the spine already has a fixture value, and Nonempty of a function type follows from an inhabited codomain. So a fundamental cannot be a computed property of the model. It must be a DECLARED OBLIGATION carried by the model, with machine-checkable parts."
  :field-that-would-carry-the-marker
